<title>USA: PSH Master to sell hotels, liquidate.</title>
<headline>PSH Master to sell hotels, liquidate.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSH Master LP I said on Friday it has agreed to sell all three of its hotels to a FelCor Suite Hotels Inc affiliate for $64.8 million, leading to the liquidation of the partnership.</p>
<p>The sale, which is expected to occur within 75 days, will result in a distribution of $5.00 to $5.50 per partnership unit, PSH said.</p>
<p>The hotels are located in Tampa, Fla.; Lake Buena Vista, Fla.; and Durham, N.C., and will continue to be managed by Doubletree Corp, PSH Master said.</p>
<p>The closing is subject to unitholder and other approvals, the company said.</p>
